{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013EaBFVfk8F6hW5tMEeGdKJ","type":"tool_result","content":"165:- `E.ik3(a, b, L1, L2, hint)`: two-bone IK in 3D: returns [joint, end]. hint points the way the joint should bend.\n179:- `E.rng(s)`: a seeded random stream: const R = E.rng(42); R() gives 0..1, the same numbers for the same seed (mulberry32)\n468:- `game.addPlayer(o = {})` †: a player in now: { pad: index } (a gamepad) or { keys: 'right' } (the keyboard's right half; player 1 takes the left). Returns its input (null when four play already)\n471:- `game.allowJoin(o = {})` †: let players join, up to max (2..4): Start on a gamepad no one holds, or 2 on the keyboard (o.keys: false not); onJoin (input, number) as each does. allowJoin(false) closes it (the names split and join are String's and Array's)\n496:- `game.script(fn, o)` †: run a coroutine on game time, in the update step: game.script(function* (game) { yield .5; yield E.until(() => door.open); yield game.tween(cam, { y: 0 }, 1); yield E.all([a, b]); ... }, { keep }). Each yield waits: a number (seconds), nothing (one step), a condition (a\n501:- `game.splitScreen(n, o = {})` †: split the screen into n viewports (2 to 4; 0 or 1: one screen again), o: { layout: 'auto' (side by side on a wide screen, stacked on a tall one; a grid for 3 or 4) | 'columns' | 'rows' | 'grid', follow: [targets], z: 16, gap: 1 }\n599:- `E.until(fn)` †: a script's wait until fn() is true: yield E.until(() => door.open)\n604:- `path.at(d)` †: the point d along it: { x, y, z, angle (its heading on the ground, radians: 0 east), d } (closed: d wraps round; open: held at the ends)\n1135:- `new E.Menu(game, items, o = {}) → menu`: Menu with a cursor (title screens, pause menus, shops, battle commands). const menu = new E.Menu(game, ['START', 'OPTIONS', { label: 'CONTINUE', disabled: !save }], { onPick(i, item) {...}, onCancel() {...} }); update: menu.update(dt) draw: menu.draw(\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174731__x326e4b/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbb0a1ea-12f9-46f9-9677-d2d253a967c8","uuid":"b1104366-6684-4577-a0b3-673058933ef0","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:15:04.616Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"165:- `E.ik3(a, b, L1, L2, hint)`: two-bone IK in 3D: returns [joint, end]. hint points the way the joint should bend.\n179:- `E.rng(s)`: a seeded random stream: const R = E.rng(42); R() gives 0..1, the same numbers for the same seed (mulberry32)\n468:- `game.addPlayer(o = {})` †: a player in now: { pad: index } (a gamepad) or { keys: 'right' } (the keyboard's right half; player 1 takes the left). Returns its input (null when four play already)\n471:- `game.allowJoin(o = {})` †: let players join, up to max (2..4): Start on a gamepad no one holds, or 2 on the keyboard (o.keys: false not); onJoin (input, number) as each does. allowJoin(false) closes it (the names split and join are String's and Array's)\n496:- `game.script(fn, o)` †: run a coroutine on game time, in the update step: game.script(function* (game) { yield .5; yield E.until(() => door.open); yield game.tween(cam, { y: 0 }, 1); yield E.all([a, b]); ... }, { keep }). Each yield waits: a number (seconds), nothing (one step), a condition (a\n501:- `game.splitScreen(n, o = {})` †: split the screen into n viewports (2 to 4; 0 or 1: one screen again), o: { layout: 'auto' (side by side on a wide screen, stacked on a tall one; a grid for 3 or 4) | 'columns' | 'rows' | 'grid', follow: [targets], z: 16, gap: 1 }\n599:- `E.until(fn)` †: a script's wait until fn() is true: yield E.until(() => door.open)\n604:- `path.at(d)` †: the point d along it: { x, y, z, angle (its heading on the ground, radians: 0 east), d } (closed: d wraps round; open: held at the ends)\n1135:- `new E.Menu(game, items, o = {}) → menu`: Menu with a cursor (title screens, pause menus, shops, battle commands). const menu = new E.Menu(game, ['START', 'OPTIONS', { label: 'CONTINUE', disabled: !save }], { onPick(i, item) {...}, onCancel() {...} }); update: menu.update(dt) draw: menu.draw(","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174731__x326e4b/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174740__x7ef5ea/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":1290,"oldLines":3,"newStart":1290,"newLines":4,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":9250,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":50,\"session_id\":\"5176bdbd-8f33-407b-b89e-9fc1c745933d\",\"uuid\":\"5d02cbd0-79da-45c3-b45e-61c7f6710e87\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":9350,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"5176bdbd-8f33-407b-b89e-9fc1c745933d\",\"uuid\":\"defc62a3-7482-4185-bf3a-2a74f7b366a4\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":9500,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"5176bdbd-8f33-407b-b89e-9fc1c745933d\",\"uuid\":\"83b13ebe-c339-4e61-97e1-868ad5d43798\"}","+{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":9650,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"5176bdbd-8f33-407b-b89e-9fc1c745933d\",\"uuid\":\"8835f751-7a8e-4bf7-9d00-34774d5f2549\"}"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174804__x8cc180/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":1343,"oldLines":3,"newStart":1343,"newLines":4,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":850,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"01565e32-5dd5-4107-91e6-1b53667edea6\",\"uuid\":\"3305b1a2-0858-4a6e-99e1-bc0254472d6e\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":1000,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"01565e32-5dd5-4107-91e6-1b53667edea6\",\"uuid\":\"85d46b77-f2da-43