d exit-interview content.\n\n**Build order.** The renderer comes first because it's the biggest risk. Then the core loop, the enemy roster and an early networking prototype, then one stage at a time, then menus, dev mode, co-op and the hub. If time runs short, the plan says which whole areas to cut; no mechanic gets cut.\n\n**Testing.** One command prints only failures and a count. It covers about 25 test suites, bot playthroughs of every stage and the whole game, browser checks at four screen sizes, and the four AI Hub harness scenarios.\n\n**For the next stage:** `/tmp` on this machine is full, which made my first `git clone` fail. The plan tells builders to point `TMPDIR` at their own folder before running Chromium or Playwright. I deleted my research clones.\n\nSources:\n- [Time Crisis 3 – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time_Crisis_3)","ttft_ms":2285,"type":"result","duration_ms":2558033,"uuid":"6e64fda6-c70c-40d9-aeaa-bafcf6d19957","ttft_stream_ms":2081,"time_to_request_ms":94,"first_content_frame_ms":2081,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":112,"outputTokens":227997,"cacheReadInputTokens":8707304,"cacheCreationInputTokens":384663,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":9.379152800000002,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":161900,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":384663,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":32393,"outputTokens":3570,"cacheReadInputTokens":872,"cacheCreationInputTokens":223514,"webSearchRequests":1,"costUSD":0.15591975,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":2016,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":223514,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
